                                    'bbh 2023/12/29 *** end *** Important note:  additions above would set up run to run if more than 1 run does it (and probably make LABEMPS, Uganda, unskilled, enegy negative

                                    'CLABEMPS(ctry.Country)(SCount%, Total) = IFsUnskilledLab(SCount%) + IFsSkilledLab(SCount%)
